    "text": "Atomic number of Ag, Hg, Zn and Co is 47, 80, 30 and 27 respectively.<br /><br />Write the electronic configuration of each and see if there are any unpaired electrons.<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">In C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>[Ar]3</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />4 unpaired electrons. So, it will be coloured."
